hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"928","Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala’ and Sa’id bin Abdul-Rahman Al-Makhzoumi told us, they said: Sufyan narrated to us, Al-Zuhri narrated to us, on the authority of Urwa, on the authority of Aisha, she said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, prayed in a khamisah with signs on it, and he said: “The signs of this one have occupied me, take it to my father.” Jahm, and bring me something that is pure.” Al-Makhzoumi said: On the authority of Al-Zuhri, and he also said: With something that is pure."
"929","He said: And they said: Sufyan narrated to us, on the authority of Hisham bin Urwa, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Aisha with this."
